1
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:08,379
(Raj:)You know, I thought cleaning out
a dead professor's office

2
00:00:08,382 --> 00:00:09,812
(Raj:)was gonna just be boring,

3
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:12,317
(Raj:)but then I found his dentures

4
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,390
(Raj:)and realized it's also gross.

5
00:00:17,258 --> 00:00:20,328
(Howard:)Doesn't Professor Abbott's
family want any of this stuff?

6
00:00:20,328 --> 00:00:21,298
(Leonard:)I don't think he had a family.

7
00:00:21,295 --> 00:00:22,965
(Raj:)That's rough.
I know.

8
00:00:22,964 --> 00:00:24,564
(Leonard:)You can spend your whole life
working,

9
00:00:24,565 --> 00:00:27,735
(Leonard:)and at the end all that's left
are some papers in a box.

10
00:00:27,735 --> 00:00:30,735
(Howard:)Makes you think.

11
00:00:30,738 --> 00:00:33,508
(Howard:)Oh, well.

12
00:00:33,508 --> 00:00:35,938
(Leonard:)Hey. Hey, we're supposed to
look through all this stuff

13
00:00:35,943 --> 00:00:37,773
(Leonard:)before we throw it away
in case it's important.

14
00:00:37,778 --> 00:00:40,748
I-I did.
It's all outdated or disproved.

15
00:00:40,748 --> 00:00:43,918
(Raj:)I don't know. This old pen
kind of proves gravity.

16
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:47,158
(Raj:)When I tilt it, her bathing
suit falls right off.

17
00:00:47,155 --> 00:00:48,325
WOLOWITZ:
Oh,

18
00:00:48,322 --> 00:00:50,322
(Howard:)my dad used to have
a pen like that.

19
00:00:50,324 --> 00:00:53,594
(Howard:)I dated it
all through sixth grade.

20
00:00:53,594 --> 00:00:54,694
(Leonard:)It still feels weird

21
00:00:54,695 --> 00:00:56,995
(Leonard:)just throwing away his work
like this.

22
00:00:56,998 --> 00:00:58,098
(Howard:)Don't feel bad.
Someday,

23
00:00:58,099 --> 00:01:00,929
(Howard:)someone will be throwing out
your work, too.

24
00:01:00,935 --> 00:01:06,025
(Leonard:)That someone was Sheldon,
and the day was yesterday.

